    "text": "The incorrect statement about carbonate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msubsup><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mfenced></math> ion is,",
