    {
      "id": "jWTf9",
      "text": "Hydrolysis of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> ion gives basic solution",
